        {
          "text": "Nyini kit Daudi Siklak, kïchöghchï kongotichi poyi Yuda kareranpa pöröwechay kipörï akïlenchï, “Achï ropöw cho le chikwa cho pö pöröwo pung pö ECHOTYON.” ",
          "type": "text",
